1 NAME Edvard Wilhelm /von Rechenberg/
2 GIVN Edvard Wilhelm
2 _MARNM von Rechenberg
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1701
2 PLAC Ottarp
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hästveda
3 STAE Skåne County
3 CTRY Sweden
