1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Supplication by Simon Fraser, merchant in the city of Riga, as follows:- He is descended of the house of Philorth, lawfully procreated between the deceased Magnus Fraser, sometime bailie of Fraserburgh, and Margar
2 CONC et Brunshaw: and, being now resident among strangers, he requires a birthbrief in terms of the testificate produced signed by the Lairds of Philorth, elder and younger. The Lords grant warrant to the Director of Chancery to extend
2 CONC  a birthbrief accordingly, and give order to the keeper of the great seal to append the same thereto."
2 CONT
