1 NOTE {geni:about_me} a. Karstemois (Karste), Kanepi vald, Põlvamaa, Estland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Conrad von Rosen, b. 1720, d. at Kastemois 7 Aug 1781, of Karstemois, Colonel in Russian service,
2 CONT
2 CONT m. 1stly 1764 baroness Sophie Renate von Wrangell (in her 2nd marriage, m. 1stly Bartholomaeus Wilhelm Bielsky, of Ruil in Estonia. She was bur. 6 Sep 1765); 
2 CONT
2 CONT m. 2ndly at Reval 5 Mar 1766 to Anna Margarethe Eleonore von Staal (b. at Hähl in Estonia 7 Jun 1730, d. 26 Apr 1810), daughter of Friedrich Johann von Staal, of Hähl (d. 1767) and his wife Beate Charlotte von Straleborn.
