1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Baltzar von Falkenberg. Heir to Schönermark, lord of Ermes and Salisburg in Livland. Came to Livland and became a country councillor in Livland in 1547 and marshal with the master Herman von Brüggeney. Died 1557. M
2 CONC arried in 1549 to Margareta von Blanckenfelt in her first marriage (married 2nd with Martin von Boldeck, who was murdered in 1563-06-10 at his home in Salisburg by his brother-in-law Frans and Christoffer von Blanckenfelt. Married
2 CONC  3:o with his brother-in-law the horseman of Swedish service Tomas von Boldeck) (At (Sch).), died in 1572, daughter of Polish knighthood in Livland hauptman Frans Joachimsson von Blanckenfelt, to Vollmar and Blanckenfeltshof, and 
2 CONC Kunigunda von Tiesenhausen.
2 CONT
