1 NOTE {geni:about_me} THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF THAT WILHELMINE ARMFELT (MARRIED FEDERLEY) WOULD HAVE BEEN A DAUGHTER OF THE DUCHESS ANNA DOROTHEA  AND G.M. ARMFELT. A WILD ROMANTIC GUESS AND SPECULATION. ARMFLFELT´S DAUGHTER PROBABLY BUT
2 CONC  VERY UNLIKELY WITH THE DUCHESS.
