1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ulrika Armfelt (Wallman) pretended to be pregnant by filling up her belly step by step until Mina was born in Germany. Very soon GMA went to Germany to fetch Mina and brought her in secrecy '''to Turku whre Mina wa
2 CONC s Christened 21.12.1798 and registered as born 20.12.1798''' as the daughter of Ulrika and Fredrik Armfelt. Source, www.federley.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilhelmina Gustava Charlotta Armfelt var '''adoptivdotter''' till Ulrika and Fredrik Armfelt. [http://www.geni.com/people/Gustaf-Armfelt/6000000006127523501 Gustaf Mauritz Armfelt]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dotter utom äktenskapet till Gustaf Mauritz Armfelt och Anna Dorothea Duchess of Kurland.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.helsinki.fi/ylioppilasmatrikkeli/henkilo.php?id=12922]
2 CONT
2 CONT No hard facts have been found to support this "qualified" guess about the identity of the mother. Family gossip and the adoption by Armfelt gave reason to try to find a plausible identity.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Olettamus että kyseinen Gustaf Mauritz Armfeltin'in 1812 adoptoitu tytär Wilhelmina Armfelt s. 29.12.1798 Turussa, olisi myös hänen biologinen tyttärensä ei perustu mihinkään vahvistettuun tietoon. Kirkonkirjoissa hän on merkit
2 CONC ty Fredrik ja Ulrika Armfeltin tyttäreksi. '''Tiedot on vahvistettu''' (SL).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Turun ruotsalainen syntyneet 1756-1803 (AP I C2:2; SSHY http://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=26820&pnum=296 / Viitattu 16.01.2024<br>
2 CONT f/s Åbo/Turku (father/isä Fredrik Armfelt and mother/äiti Ulrica Wallman): http://hiski.genealogia.fi/hiski/7jv2fb?fi+0568+kastetut+4692<br>
2 CONT HISKI  20.12.1798	21.12.1798	 	 	'''Lieutenanten Herr Baron Fridric Armfelts	Frú Ulrica Wallmans	BARN Gustava Wilhelmina C'''<br>
2 CONT '''Turun ruotsalainen , Syntyneet''', 1756-1803	JK1184-1185	Kuva 309: http://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/kirjat/Kirkonkirjat/turun_ruotsalainen/syntyneet_1756-1803_jk1184-1185/309.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.federley.com/index02.html, Please see here; It is known that GMA during his staying abroad had an affair with the Dutchess of Kurland, Anna Charlotta Dorothea von Biron b. von Medem, in the beginning of 1798. Approximat
2 CONC ely 9 months later a girl, Mina was born. The pregnancy and birth was kept in total secrecy. To make this possible Ulrika Armfelt in Finland pretended to be pregnant by filling up her belly step by step until Mina was born in Germ
2 CONC any. Very soon GMA went to Germany to fetch Mina and brought her in secrecy to Turku/Åbo where Mina was christened 21.12.1798 and registered as born 20.12.1798 as the daughter of Ulrika and Fredrik Armfelt. GMA later adopted Mina.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
