2 DATE 10 JAN 1715
2 ADDR
3 CITY Karlskrona
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 MAR 1791
2 PLAC Tosterup Castle
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Tosterup
3 CITY Tomelilla
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
2 DATE 14 MAR 1791
2 PLAC Tosterup Church
2 ADDR
