2 CONC  Carolus Rosenlew. Carolus is a decendant of Vava and Lars Federley’s schoolmate.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.ancestry.com/boards/surnames.armfield/2.3.4.5.35/mb.ashx, a text written by Carolus Rosenlew. He says here that  a child, called Gustaf Edward, who was first adopted to Belgium and later on to England where he was give
2 CONC n or took the name Armfield. He is accordingly born after 1817. According to family tradition, he earned his living as an artist, but presumably he was supported by his, in those days, very wealthy mother. 
2 CONT
