1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Birth ca 1600 makes no sense since her son was born in the 1570s.''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/view/bsb11041206?page=219 Denkwürdiger und nützlicher rheinischer Antiquarius. Mittelrhein. Abteilung 3. 11. 1865]
2 CONT
