1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Catherine Von Ponickau=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT An error has crept in over time regarding the wife of Christoph von Haren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Previously shown was Catharina von Ponickau was born on 10th April 1585 at Kriebstein in Saxony. She died on 8th February 1655 at Oelzschau in Saxony. She is not and cannot be the same person as the wife of Christoph von Haren who
2 CONC  lived about 600 miles away, she had only one husband and many children and could not have been married to Christoph von Haren at the same time 600 miles away. The descendants of Christoph von Haren need to revisit their sources a
2 CONC nd find the right Catharina, if that was her name.
